          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu mwaka wa mbere umwami Dariyusi Umumedi mwene Ahasuwerusi, agiye ku ngoma, ngo abe umwami w’i Babiloni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "muri uwo mwaka wa mbere w’ingoma yiwe nyene, jewe Daniyeli natahujwe n’ivyo nsomye mw’Ijambo ry’Uhoraho, nk’uko uwavugishwa n’Imana Yeremiya yabihishuriwe, rivuga ko Yerusalemu hazomara imyaka mirongo indwi ari umusaka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9:2",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Umusaka.",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ahantu hasambuwe canke hashaje, hatakiba abantu.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nca mpindukirira ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " Imana, ntangura gutakamba ndayisenga nongera ndayinginga, nisonzesheje, nambaye amagunira kandi nisize iminyota.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nsenga ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " Imana yanje kandi ndatura nti:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkiriko ndavuga nongera nsenga, natura ivyaha vyanje n’ivyaha vy’ubwoko bwanje bw’Abisirayeli, nsaba ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " Imana yanje nsabira umusozi wayo wejejwe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nkiriko ndasenga, Gaburiyeli, umwe nari nabonye mw’iyerekwa rya mbere, aza aho ndi anyaruka, hari nk’igihe co gutanga ikimazi co ku mugoroba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arambarira ati: “Daniyeli, nzanywe no kukwungura ubwenge no kugufasha gutahura.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuva ugitangura gusenga, hatanzwe itegeko ari na ryo rinzanye, kuko uri uw’igiciro mu nyonga z’Imana. Wumvirize neza kugira ngo ushobore gutahura ico ivyo weretswe bivuga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Igihe kingana n’amayinga mirongo indwi y’imyaka, ni co cashinzwe ku bw’abantu bawe n’igisagara catoranijwe kugira ngo barangize ubugarariji bwabo, n’ivyaha vyabo bihongerwe, haze ubugororotsi bw’Imana butazoshira, ivyavuzwe n’abavugishwa n’Imana hamwe n’ivyo beretswe bishike, hanyuma Ahera Cane h’urusengero hongere hahumanurwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ubu rero, umviriza kandi utahure: kuva igihe itegeko ryo gusubira kwubaka Yerusalemu rizosohokera, hazohera amayinga indwi y’imyaka agwije incuro indwi, hanyuma habe ayandi mayinga mirongo itandatu n’abiri y’imyaka, hanyuma haze umurongozi yasizwe amavuta. Igisagara ca Yerusalemu kizokwubakwa hamwe n’amabarabara yaho, mugabo bizokorwa mu bihe bigoye cane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Inyuma y’ayo mayinga mirongo itandatu n’abiri, uwasizwe amavuta azokwicwa, mu buryo bw’akarenganyo. Inyuma y’aho, ingabo zo mu bwoko bw’umutware w’umunyamahanga azoza zizosangangura igisagara n’urusengero. Umuhero uzoza nk’umwuzure w’amazi, kandi kuva ico gihe intambara n’ivyago bizokomeza kugeza kw’iherezo ry’ibihe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uwo mutware azoza, azogirana amasezerano n’abantu benshi mu kiringo c’imyaka indwi, ariko ico gihe kigeze hagati, azokuraho ivyo gutanga ibimazi n’amashikanwa. Kugira ngo ibikorwa vyiwe bibi vyuzure, azoshinga mu rusengero ikintu kizira, bitume urusengero ruhumana, bizoguma gutyo kugeza aho iherezo ryiwe rizoshikira nk’uko vyashinzwe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
